    "body": "I'd be ok having implicit \"this\" capture only when one is within the same algorithm basically. But if for example in that example, 2.1 was a link to an algorithm elsewhere, \"this\" shouldn't be useable there, since that would be just hard to read. Reader would effectively have to go up the stack trace to see what \"this\" is.",
