    "updated_at": "2022-11-21T16:49:32Z",
    "body": "Depends how smart we expect prose to be.\r\n\r\nThinking in JS terms, the queued steps would be GC'd once they'd executed. Therefore things they reference, like [=this=], would no longer be valid references.",
